&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;style&gt;
.tf-logo { display:block; width:240px;
  max-width:100%; height:auto; }
&lt;/style&gt;</code></pre><p>BaÄŸÄ±msÄ±z bilgi gÃ¶rselinde img alt=&quot;Trueforms&quot; olur. Parent link adlandÄ±rÄ±lmÄ±ÅŸsa img alt=&quot;&quot; bÄ±rakÄ±lÄ±r. KullanÄ±lan geniÅŸliÄŸe gÃ¶re yÃ¼kseklik width / 6.140565549 formÃ¼lÃ¼yle hesaplanÄ±r. CSS width deÄŸeri deÄŸiÅŸse de oran korunur.</p><pre><code>&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source media=&quot;(prefers-color-scheme: dark)&quot;
          srcset=&quot;/brand/trueforms-logo-b-dark.svg&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&quot;/brand/trueforms-logo-b-color.svg&quot;
       alt=&quot;Trueforms&quot; width=&quot;240&quot; height=&quot;39.084&quot;
       style=&quot;max-width:100%;height:auto&quot;&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;</code></pre><p>Bu picture Ã¶rneÄŸi iÅŸletim sistemi temasÄ±nÄ± takip eder. Uygulama kendi tema seÃ§icisine sahipse logo seÃ§imini de o stateâ€™e baÄŸlayÄ±n; yalnÄ±zca prefers-color-scheme kullanmak manuel tercih ile Ã§eliÅŸebilir. Tam Ã¶rnek examples/index.html iÃ§indedir.</p><aside>tokens/trueforms.css dosyasÄ±ndaki relative font yollarÄ± paket yapÄ±sÄ±na gÃ¶redir. KlasÃ¶rleri Ã¼retime taÅŸÄ±rken URLâ€™leri birlikte gÃ¼ncelleyin. SVG pathâ€™lerini CSS ile yeniden dizmeyin.</aside></section><section id="s20"><p class="kicker">20 / MASTER HANDOFF</p><h2>Tema davranÄ±ÅŸÄ± ve Ã§alÄ±ÅŸan HTML Ã¶rnekleri</h2><p class="lead">DÃ¶rt hazÄ±r HTML giriÅŸ noktasÄ± aynÄ± varlÄ±klarÄ± kullanÄ±r. Tema seÃ§imi, renk modu ve A/B yerleÅŸimi baÄŸÄ±msÄ±z kontrol edilir.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Dosya</th><th>DavranÄ±ÅŸ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>examples/index.html</td><td>B varsayÄ±lan; sistem/aÃ§Ä±k/koyu/tek renk tema, A/B seÃ§imi, renk modu ve geniÅŸlik kontrolÃ¼.</td></tr><tr><td>examples/light.html</td><td>AÃ§Ä±k tema ile baÅŸlar. B/color hazÄ±rdÄ±r.</td></tr><tr><td>examples/dark.html</td><td>Koyu tema ile baÅŸlar. B/dark hazÄ±rdÄ±r.</td></tr><tr><td>examples/monochrome.html</td><td>Tek renk arayÃ¼zle baÅŸlar. B/black hazÄ±rdÄ±r.</td></tr><tr><td>trueforms-logo-master-spec.html</td><td>TÃ¼m master metni + gÃ¶mÃ¼lÃ¼ Ã§evrimdÄ±ÅŸÄ± logo laboratuvarÄ±; tek dosya.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>SeÃ§im</th><th>SonuÃ§</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tema = sistem</td><td>prefers-color-scheme deÄŸiÅŸince tema ve otomatik logo modu birlikte gÃ¼ncellenir.</td></tr><tr><td>Tema = aÃ§Ä±k / koyu / tek renk</td><td>Sistem tercihini geÃ§ersiz kÄ±lar; logo modu Auto ise color / dark / black seÃ§ilir.</td></tr><tr><td>Logo modu = sabit</td><td>SeÃ§ilen mod ve kendi referans zemini gÃ¶sterilir; uygulama temasÄ± ayrÄ± kalÄ±r.</td></tr><tr><td>YerleÅŸim = A</td><td>TÃ¼m modlarda hazÄ±r A dosyasÄ±na geÃ§er; elle nokta taÅŸÄ±ma yoktur.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>GeniÅŸlik kontrolÃ¼ 160 ... 600 px arasÄ±nda inceleme saÄŸlar. GerÃ§ek render geniÅŸliÄŸi, dar kapsayÄ±cÄ±yla sÄ±nÄ±rlanÄ±r ve ekranda Ã¶lÃ§Ã¼lÃ¼r.</li><li>SVG indir baÄŸlantÄ±sÄ± o anki yerleÅŸim ve renk dosyasÄ±na gider. PNGâ€™ler pakette hazÄ±rdÄ±r.</li><li>Demo form yalnÄ±zca yerel durum metni gÃ¶sterir; veri gÃ¶ndermez.</li><li>currentColor Ã¶rneÄŸi inline yerleÅŸtirilir ve ayrÄ± renk seÃ§icisinden CSS color alÄ±r.</li></ul></section><section id="s21"><p class="kicker">21 / MASTER HANDOFF</p><h2>React ve TypeScript API</h2><p class="lead">examples/TrueformsBrand.tsx, TrueformsLogo ve TrueformsIcon bileÅŸenlerini iÃ§erir. Logo B ile baÅŸlar; A, aynÄ± APIâ€™nin layout seÃ§eneÄŸidir.</p><pre><code>&lt;TrueformsLogo layout=&quot;B&quot; mode=&quot;color&quot; width={240} /&gt;
&lt;TrueformsLogo layout=&quot;A&quot; mode=&quot;dark&quot; width={240} /&gt;
&lt;TrueformsLogo layout=&quot;B&quot; mode=&quot;auto&quot; /&gt;
&lt;TrueformsIcon size={32} label=&quot;Trueforms&quot; /&gt;

&lt;a href=&quot;/&quot; aria-label=&quot;Trueforms ana sayfa&quot;&gt;
  &lt;TrueformsLogo decorative mode=&quot;white&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;</code></pre><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>TanÄ±m</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>layout</td><td>B | A; varsayÄ±lan B.</td></tr><tr><td>mode</td><td>color | dark | mono | black | white | auto. auto, picture ile sistem temasÄ±nÄ± izler.</td></tr><tr><td>width</td><td>VarsayÄ±lan 240 CSS px; height orandan hesaplanÄ±r.</td></tr><tr><td>assetBase</td><td>VarsayÄ±lan /brand; son / normalize edilir.</td></tr><tr><td>decorative</td><td>true ise alt boÅŸ; false ise alt Trueforms.</td></tr><tr><td>className / style</td><td>KapsayÄ±cÄ± stili ve class; uygulama yerleÅŸimine uyarlama.</td></tr><tr><td>Icon size / label</td><td>GÃ¶rÃ¼nÃ¼r yÃ¼kseklik / eriÅŸilebilir ad. label yoksa dekoratif.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Manuel uygulama temasÄ± iÃ§in mode deÄŸerini uygulamanÄ±n stateâ€™inden color veya dark olarak geÃ§in. mode=&quot;auto&quot; yalnÄ±zca sistem tercihidir. BileÅŸen hook ve tarayÄ±cÄ± globali kullanmaz; kendi stateâ€™ini tutmaz.</p><p>TSX kaynak teslimidir. Hedef projenin React/TypeScript sÃ¼rÃ¼mÃ¼nde typecheck ve build tamamlanmalÄ±dÄ±r. Logo currentColor modu harici img APIâ€™sine eklenmedi; o kullanÄ±m iÃ§in inline SVG Ã¶rneÄŸi saÄŸlandÄ±.</p></section><section id="s22"><p class="kicker">22 / MASTER HANDOFF</p><h2>Favicon mobil ve e posta Ã¶rnekleri</h2><p class="lead">Paket farklÄ± kullanÄ±m yÃ¼zeylerine uygun Ã¶rnek dosyalar iÃ§erir. YayÄ±n yolu ve platformun kendi kÄ±rpma davranÄ±ÅŸÄ± hedef projede kontrol edilir.</p><pre><code>&lt;link rel=&quot;icon&quot; type=&quot;image/svg+xml&quot; href=&quot;/brand/favicon.svg&quot;&gt;
&lt;link rel=&quot;icon&quot; type=&quot;image/png&quot; sizes=&quot;32x32&quot;
      href=&quot;/brand/favicon-32.png&quot;&gt;
&lt;link rel=&quot;icon&quot; type=&quot;image/x-icon&quot; href=&quot;/brand/favicon.ico&quot;&gt;
